Typewriter sounds (src/sound/samples.ts) are cut from these recordings,
edited (cut, levelled, encoded to MP3). The machines' names are their
makers' trademarks, used to say what was recorded; the makers have no
connection to this plugin.

The IBM Selectric II is cut from video recordings of the machine shared
online by their owners.

